      "x": 40,
      "y": 82,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "SCENARIO · The bank accepts a vendor payment, but the response is lost. The worker then restarts.\nGoal: one economic effect. Preserve the command/key; verify settlement, post, then reconcile.",
